            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "e0357e3c-be37-45cc-b9d9-47fcd2eb985c",
               "text": "NASA",
               "page": "https://science.nasa.gov/mission/hubble/science/science-behind-the-discoveries/hubble-constant-and-tension/",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### How Is It Expanding?\n\nTo understand what it means for the universe to be expanding, let us try a simple experiment.\n\nPlace your finger on the circle below. Watch it carefully -- you will see it **growing in different directions**.\n\nThis is exactly what is happening to the universe right now: everything is moving apart, just like the points on the surface of an inflating balloon.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<center><div class=\"htCircle\" style=\"height: 10vh; width: 10vh; background-color: white; border:1px solid black;\" name=\"fig1\"></div></center><p class=\"desc\"><b>Figure 1</b>: Circle representing the expansion of the universe. Place your finger or mouse on it to see it grow.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-4c9d-0e1f-2a3b4c5d6e7f",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-4c9d-0e1f-2a3b4c5d6e7f",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Let Us Think!\n\nIf the universe is expanding **now**, and it has been expanding for billions of years, then it was smaller in the past.\n\n**Was the universe contracted before?**",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "d4e5f6a7-b8c9-4d0e-1f2a-3b4c5d6e7f80",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "yes",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
